  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_2450590f32104fb9aff5036e1e3074e3",
      "statement": "The WebSocket relay is intentionally state-light: it authenticates connections, tracks live browser presence in an in-memory Map keyed by scopeKey+browserInstanceId, and persists nothing — presence (and the presence-derived /health data) disappears when the extension socket closes and carries no page URL, title, content, or DOM state.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/architecture/decisions/0021-local-pairing-presence-routing.md#L44-L56",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:62f41f66800c93d96e03bc38ef2d6dc7a57beaae270324a926ab3d25131db222:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://servers/websocket/src/server.ts#L154-L171",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0bd6f479d63c3d87589f0df5a1e361220738302e09d37af2acb3fca797b90726:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://servers/websocket/src/server.ts#L86-L89",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4746faf9580fdb1f40d65fda116a34d3080256556a4b093ca66152f1d958cd3b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d0130aeeb4974f9890c77f0ede49819a",
      "statement": "The relay fails to start unless BRIJIO_PAIRING_TOKEN is configured (BRIJIO_TOKEN is accepted as a fallback); accepted tokens are a Set built from options.pairingToken plus additionalPairingTokens, so only listed tokens authenticate.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://servers/websocket/src/index.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:e0f6605a7e1def495322c60b48db3217cea305f32ac47b42db2662db837a1240"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://servers/websocket/src/server.ts#L136-L148",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:70ba4167665b802447b9b234366c91ea0e0a83863c9ba68ecd53fbd1fc27d469:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_33aca96fc58e4b958d773f2bc54d1206",
      "statement": "Unauthenticated sockets must send an auth payload first; non-auth payloads return auth_required and invalid tokens return auth_failed. On success the relay sets state.role and state.scopeKey (SHA-256 of the token via createScopeKey, so the raw token is never stored in presence or logged in full), returns auth_success, and for extensions immediately sends a browser_presence_request.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/shared/src/protocol.ts#L988-L1009",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3e1e77c7defe40f79f7d023f04b0963f11a3609f7f437a77ef24c6a6cd89d6b7:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://servers/websocket/src/protocol.ts#L4-L5",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:77576227c4dbc756ef814366cccf3ac6ad269ffe7ab4611850398cf82ea89eec:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://servers/websocket/src/server.ts#L150-L184",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:26bbfa6191e339997b018bd9fd72f7a1c222aa7a970ee9e5629f2e6163e96cec:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7184dd2128f34d60b332da03519131e6",
      "statement": "Token scope isolation is enforced end-to-end: createScopeKey derives a per-token scopeKey, presence is keyed by scopeKey+browserInstanceId, list_browsers returns only browsers in the caller's scopeKey with OPEN sockets, and pendingRequests are keyed by scopeKey+requestId — so clients with different pairing tokens never see one another's browsers or responses.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://servers/websocket/src/server.ts#L309-L322",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:06949d90c6f00008104bd922a7fb7d67381e1d5dd77771799e5ee036e974a09d:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://servers/websocket/src/server.ts#L403-L417",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d22ec0d9939d5d1ba68db16801c728c995779515d0f32308acdb50f052a3aebf:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://servers/websocket/src/server.ts#L439-L441",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9665400aead7a9230ba2efae236e96e4827a06972424e0a6e82dccfe9042bf8b:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://servers/websocket/src/server.ts#L86-L89",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4746faf9580fdb1f40d65fda116a34d3080256556a4b093ca66152f1d958cd3b:"
        }
      ]
